rs/sureshdash2022-yb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2022-11-02T03:50:41Z","updated_at":"2022-11-04T05:28:37Z","closed_at":"2022-11-04T05:28:37Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-4106](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-4106)\r\nAfter compiling the code from master branch and running the Debezium connector there, as soon as I insert a record in one of the tables, I get this error from the connector:\r\n```\r\n2022-10-30 17:12:00,494 INFO   YugabyteDB|dbserver1|streaming  Schema for table 'public.test' is missing   [io.debezium.connector.yugabytedb.YugabyteDBChangeRecordEmitter]\r\n```\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n1. Create database: `CREATE DATABASE testdb colocated = true;`\r\n2. Create tables: `create table test (id int primary key) with (colocated=true);` and `create table test2 (name text primary key) with (colocated=true);`\r\n3. Create stream and run the CDC pipeline\r\n4. Insert a record in any of the tables, the above mentioned error is produced.\r\n\r\nAfter printing the DDL record, it looked something like:\r\n```\r\nrow_message {\r\n  table: \"test2\"\r\n  op: DDL\r\n  schema {\r\n    column_info {\r\n      name: \"parent_column\"\r\n      type {\r\n        main: BINARY\r\n      }\r\n      is_key: true\r\n      is_hash_key: false\r\n      is_nullable: false\r\n      oid: 0\r\n    }\r\n    tab_info {\r\n      default_time_to_live: 0\r\n      num_tablets: 0\r\n      is_ysql_catalog_table: false\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  schema_version: 0\r\n  pgschema_name: \"\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nrow_message {\r\n  table: \"test\"\r\n  op: DDL\r\n  schema {\r\n    column_info {\r\n      name: \"parent_column\"\r\n      type {\r\n        main: BINARY\r\n      }\r\n      is_key: true\r\n      is_hash_key: false\r\n      is_nullable: false\r\n      oid: 0\r\n    }\r\n    tab_info {\r\n      default_time_to_live: 0\r\n      num_tablets: 0\r\n      is_ysql_catalog_table: false\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  schema_version: 0\r\n  pgschema_name: \"\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere seem to be 2 things wrong with the above DDL record:\r\n1. `pgschema_name` is missing\r\n2. Column name is coming out as `parent_column` instead of what the actual value is","closed_by":{"login":"sureshdash2022-yb","id":91429208,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDI5MjA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91429208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb","html_url":"https://github.com/sureshdash2022-yb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshdash2022-yb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/14788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart